#. module: website_switzerland
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_switzerland.my_event_include_forms
msgid ""
"*\n"
"                                <i>We accept photos or scanned documents. In case you are not equipped with a camera, a\n"
"                                    smartphone or a scanner, you can send us the documents at Compassion Switzerland,\n"
"                                    Rue Galilée 3, 1400 Yverdon-les-Bains.\n"
"                                </i>"
msgstr ""
"*<i>Nous acceptons photo ou document scanné. Si vous n'êtes pas équipés d'un"
" scanner, d'un appareil photo ou d'un smartphone pour effectuer la photo, "
"vous pouvez nous envoyer ce document par poste à Compassion Suisse, rue "
"Galilée 3, 1400 Yverdon-les-Bains.</i>"

#. module: website_switzerland
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_switzerland.my_event_include_forms
msgid ""
"<b>In this perspective, we thank you to complete the following tasks:</b>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Dans cette perspective, merci de compléter les tâches suivantes :</b>"

#. module: website_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:website_switzerland.group_visit_detailed_info_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"registration\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"registration.compassion_event_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    This is the final stretch: it's time to prepare your luggage for Compassion's trip. To make it easier for you, we have provided a small folder to read as soon as you have a moment. It contains information about:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>the meeting with your sponsored child</li>\n"
"                    <li>Compassion Programs</li>\n"
"                    <li>the country, the climate, the customs</li>\n"
"                    <li>your luggage and the little gifts you could take with you</li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Keep this email carefully to access the information. <b>To find out more, simply click here:</b>.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    </p><div style=\"margin:0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"                        <a href=\"\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #0054A6; border-color:#FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"                            Practical information\n"
"                        </a>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    If you still have questions, <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/{{event.website_url}}/faq\" style=\"color: skyblue; text-decoration: underline\">you will find here</a> the main questions asked by people interested in travelling with Compassion. You can also send us an email at rreber@compassion.ch if you can't find an answer to your question.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Thank you for your commitment to children in need.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Receive our warmest greetings.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Rose-Marie Reber\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Sponsor and donor service\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"                \n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: website_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:website_switzerland.group_visit_step3_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"registration\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"registration.compassion_event_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    We have received the documents and the payment of the deposit required for the registration for the <t t-out=\"event.name\"></t>. Thank you very much!\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    In the coming weeks, you will be guided through the preparations for your trip. What can you expect in concrete terms?\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ol>\n"
"                    <li>Health information</li>\n"
"                    <li>Information on travel and insurance documents</li>\n"
"                    <li>Information on the information and preparation meeting</li>\n"
"                    <li>Information on the country and climate</li>\n"
"                    <li>Information about Compassion's work and meeting your sponsored child</li>\n"
"                </ol>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/{{event.website_url}}/faq\" style=\"color: skyblue; text-decoration: underline\">Here you will find (click here)</a> the main questions asked by people interested in travelling with Compassion. You can also send us an email at rreber@compassion.ch if you can't find an answer to your question.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Once again, thank you for your commitment to children in need.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Receive our warmest greetings.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Rose-Marie Reber\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Sponsor and donor service\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: website_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:website_switzerland.group_visit_medical_discharge_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"registration\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"registration.compassion_event_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    We received your answers to the medical survey and we thank you for taking the time to complete it.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Based on your answers, it seems you are undergoing on a medical treatment. For that purpose we need a medical discharge from your doctor, confirming us that your medical status still allows you to travel to <t t-out=\"event.country_id.name\"></t>.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Please find attached a template letter that you can fill with your information, print and give it to your doctor to sign. You can then send us back the signed letter at our postal addres or <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/event/{{registration.uuid}}/medical_discharge\">directly online by clicking here</a>.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Receive our warmest greetings.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Rose-Marie Reber\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Sponsor and donor service\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: website_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:website_switzerland.group_visit_after_trip_party_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"registration\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"registration.compassion_event_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"meeting\" t-value=\"registration.event_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"user\" t-value=\"meeting.user_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"url\" t-value=\"registration.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;) + &#x27;/event/&#x27; + registration.uuid + &#x27;/after_party&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    We hope that your journey <t t-out=\"event.country_id.preposition\"></t> <t t-out=\"event.country_id.name\"></t> has been an enriching experience for you.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Compassion invites you to an after party, where the participants can meet once again in order to spend some more time together and share our feedback. The party will take place in <t t-out=\"meeting.address_id.city\"></t> on <t t-out=\"meeting.get_date(&#x27;date_begin&#x27;)\"></t> at <t t-out=\"meeting.get_date(&#x27;date_begin&#x27;, &#x27;%H:%M&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <b>Please confirm your participation by clicking here:</b>.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    </p><div style=\"margin:0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"                        <a t-attf-href=\"{{url}}\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #0054A6; border-color:#FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"                            Accept/Decline invitation\n"
"                        </a>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    We look forward to seeing you again on this occasion.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Receive our warmest greetings.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                     <t t-out=\"user.preferred_name\"></t> <t t-out=\"user.lastname\"></t>\n"
"                      <br/>\n"
"                      <t t-out=\"user.employee_ids.department_id.name\"></t>\n"
"                      <br/>\n"
"                    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"                \n"
"\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: website_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:website_switzerland.group_visit_information_day_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"registration\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"registration.compassion_event_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"meeting\" t-value=\"registration.event_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"user\" t-value=\"meeting.user_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"url\" t-value=\"registration.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;) + &#x27;/event/&#x27; + registration.uuid + &#x27;/meeting_invitation&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Your journey <t t-out=\"event.country_id.preposition\"></t> <t t-out=\"event.country_id.name\"></t> is fast approaching.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    An unforgettable experience is being prepared. In this perspective, Compassion invites you to a meeting of the participants in <t t-out=\"meeting.address_id.city\"></t> on <t t-out=\"meeting.get_date(&#x27;date_begin&#x27;)\"></t> at <t t-out=\"meeting.get_date(&#x27;date_begin&#x27;, &#x27;%H:%M&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    On this occasion, we will present you the work of Compassion <t t-out=\"event.country_id.preposition\"></t> <t t-out=\"event.country_id.name\"></t> as well as the detailed program of the trip. There will also be a time for Questions &amp; Answers and an aperitif to get to know each other.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <b>Please confirm your participation by clicking here:</b>.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    </p><div style=\"margin:0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"                        <a t-attf-href=\"{{url}}\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #0054A6; border-color:#FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"                            Accept/Decline invitation\n"
"                        </a>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    We look forward to meeting you (or seeing you again) on this occasion.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Receive our warmest greetings.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                     <t t-out=\"user.preferred_name\"></t> <t t-out=\"user.lastname\"></t>\n"
"                      <br/>\n"
"                      <t t-out=\"user.employee_ids.department_id.name\"></t>\n"
"                      <br/>\n"
"                    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"                \n"
"\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: website_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:website_switzerland.group_visit_step1_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"registration\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"registration.compassion_event_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Your registration for the <t t-out=\"event.name\"></t> is progressing well. Thank you very much for your interest in Compassion's\n"
"    work to free more children from poverty every day, for a dignified and meaningful life.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    To confirm your registration, you only need to pay a deposit of <t t-out=\"object.user_id.company_id.currency_id.symbol\"></t>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;%d&#x27; |format(registration.event_ticket_id.price)\"></t>.- You have the choice to make this payment:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Online by Credit card or Postfinance card\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        <div style=\"margin:40px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"            <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/event/{{registration.uuid}}/down_payment\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);padding:12px 18px;font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #0054A6; border-color:#FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #FFFFFF; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"                Online payment\n"
"            </a>\n"
"        </div>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        By paying using the payment slip attached to this email\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We thank you in advance for making this payment today or in the coming days.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    The next step will be to prepare for the trip. Here again, you will receive the information you need to know in time\n"
"    to make this trip an enriching and unforgettable experience for you.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/{{event.website_url}}/faq\" style=\"background-color:transparent;color:skyblue;text-decoration: underline\">Here you will find (click here)</a> the main questions asked by people interested in travelling with Compassion. You can also email us at info@compassion.ch if you can't find an answer to your question.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Once again, thank you for your commitment to children in need.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""

